  "terms_title": "Terms & Policies",
  "terms_section_1_title": "1. General Introduction",
  "terms_section_1_content": "Welcome to FoodGo - your online food ordering app. By using FoodGo's services, you agree to our terms, conditions, and privacy policy. Please read carefully before using.\n\nFoodGo provides a platform connecting users with stores and menus, supporting delivery and payment throughout the ordering process. We are committed to delivering the best experience for our users.",
  "terms_section_2_title": "2. Rights & Responsibilities",
  "terms_section_2_content": "Users have the right to use FoodGo services in accordance with Vietnamese law. You are entitled to a safe shopping experience, on-time delivery, and support when issues arise.\n\nAt the same time, users are responsible for not using the service for illegal purposes, fraud, or harming FoodGo's systems. Any violations will be subject to legal liability.",
  "terms_section_3_title": "3. Payment Policy",
  "terms_section_3_content": "FoodGo accepts multiple payment methods: cash on delivery (COD), credit/debit cards (Visa, Mastercard), and e-wallets (MoMo, ZaloPay, VNPay).\n\nAll payment transactions are processed through a secure system. We do not store your bank card information on our servers. All information is encrypted according to international standards.",
  "terms_section_4_title": "4. Refund Policy",
  "terms_section_4_content": "In case your order is cancelled or not delivered due to errors from the store/driver, you will receive a 100% refund within 3-5 business days.\n\nIf a product does not match its description, please contact support within 24 hours of receiving the order for prompt assistance.",
